{"lang":"en","summary":"Navigation: 总纲MOC | 目录","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"行为面试 MOC\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> moc\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"行为面试\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> meta/moc\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> interview/行为面试\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> interview/STAR法则</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E6%80%BB%E7%BA%B2MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E6%80%BB%E7%BA%B2MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">总纲MOC</a> | <a data-tooltip-position=\"top\" aria-label=\"01-面试题集/11-行为面试/\" data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">目录</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"行为面试 MOC\" dir=\"auto\">行为面试 MOC</h1>\n<blockquote dir=\"auto\">\n<p>行为面试（Behavioral Interview）考察候选人的软技能、项目经验、问题解决能力和团队协作。共 <strong>7 题</strong>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"STAR 法则\" dir=\"auto\">STAR 法则</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">回答行为面试题的通用框架：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>环节</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>S</strong> — Situation</td>\n<td>情境</td>\n<td>描述项目背景和当时的情况</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>T</strong> — Task</td>\n<td>任务</td>\n<td>明确你的职责和目标任务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>A</strong> — Action</td>\n<td>行动</td>\n<td>详细说明你采取的具体行动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>R</strong> — Result</td>\n<td>结果</td>\n<td>量化成果，展示价值和影响</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3 data-heading=\"STAR 法则使用要点\" dir=\"auto\">STAR 法则使用要点</h3>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>具体化</strong> — 避免泛泛而谈，用数据说话</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>突出\"我\"</strong> — 强调个人贡献，而非团队整体</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>有始有终</strong> — 完整描述从问题到解决的全过程</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>反思总结</strong> — 在 Result 中加入反思和改进</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"面试题集\" dir=\"auto\">面试题集</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>编号</th>\n<th>题目</th>\n<th>考察点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a data-tooltip-position=\"top\" aria-label=\"Q01-STAR法则介绍项目\" data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/11-%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/Q01-STAR%E6%B3%95%E5%88%99%E4%BB%8B%E7%BB%8D%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/11-%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/Q01-STAR%E6%B3%95%E5%88%99%E4%BB%8B%E7%BB%8D%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Q01</a></td>\n<td>用 STAR 法则介绍自己的 Agent 项目</td>\n<td>项目表达</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a data-tooltip-position=\"top\" aria-label=\"Q02-技术选型决策\" data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/11-%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/Q02-%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E9%80%89%E5%9E%8B%E5%86%B3%E7%AD%96/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/11-%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/Q02-%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E9%80%89%E5%9E%8B%E5%86%B3%E7%AD%96/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Q02</a></td>\n<td>技术选型决策过程</td>\n<td>决策能力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a data-tooltip-position=\"top\" aria-label=\"Q03-最困难技术挑战\" data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/11-%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/Q03-%E6%9C%80%E5%9B%B0%E9%9A%BE%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E6%8C%91%E6%88%98/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/11-%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/Q03-%E6%9C%80%E5%9B%B0%E9%9A%BE%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E6%8C%91%E6%88%98/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Q03</a></td>\n<td>最困难的技术挑战及解决</td>\n<td>问题解决</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a data-tooltip-position=\"top\" aria-label=\"Q04-Bad-Case收集与持续迭代\" data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/11-%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/Q04-Bad-Case%E6%94%B6%E9%9B%86%E4%B8%8E%E6%8C%81%E7%BB%AD%E8%BF%AD%E4%BB%A3/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/11-%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/Q04-Bad-Case%E6%94%B6%E9%9B%86%E4%B8%8E%E6%8C%81%E7%BB%AD%E8%BF%AD%E4%BB%A3/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Q04</a></td>\n<td>Bad Case 收集与持续迭代</td>\n<td>质量意识</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a data-tooltip-position=\"top\" aria-label=\"Q05-安全性与隐私保护\" data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/11-%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/Q05-%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%8E%E9%9A%90%E7%A7%81%E4%BF%9D%E6%8A%A4/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/11-%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/Q05-%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%8E%E9%9A%90%E7%A7%81%E4%BF%9D%E6%8A%A4/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Q05</a></td>\n<td>Agent 系统安全性和隐私保护</td>\n<td>安全意识</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a data-tooltip-position=\"top\" aria-label=\"Q06-团队协作完成Agent项目\" data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/11-%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/Q06-%E5%9B%A2%E9%98%9F%E5%8D%8F%E4%BD%9C%E5%AE%8C%E6%88%90Agent%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/11-%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/Q06-%E5%9B%A2%E9%98%9F%E5%8D%8F%E4%BD%9C%E5%AE%8C%E6%88%90Agent%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Q06</a></td>\n<td>团队协作完成复杂 Agent 项目</td>\n<td>团队协作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a data-tooltip-position=\"top\" aria-label=\"Q07-从失败中学习\" data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/11-%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/Q07-%E4%BB%8E%E5%A4%B1%E8%B4%A5%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/11-%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/Q07-%E4%BB%8E%E5%A4%B1%E8%B4%A5%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Q07</a></td>\n<td>从失败中学习的经历</td>\n<td>成长心态</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"考察维度分析\" dir=\"auto\">考察维度分析</h2>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">行为面试考察维度\n├── 技术深度\n│   ├── [[Q01-STAR法则介绍项目|项目介绍]] — 技术选型的合理性\n│   ├── [[Q02-技术选型决策|选型决策]] — 技术判断能力\n│   └── [[Q03-最困难技术挑战|技术挑战]] — 问题解决深度\n├── 质量意识\n│   ├── [[Q04-Bad-Case收集与持续迭代|Bad Case处理]] — 持续改进\n│   └── [[Q05-安全性与隐私保护|安全隐私]] — 工程素养\n├── 团队协作\n│   └── [[Q06-团队协作完成Agent项目|团队协作]] — 沟通与配合\n└── 软技能\n    └── [[Q07-从失败中学习|失败学习]] — 成长型思维\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"答题模板\" dir=\"auto\">答题模板</h2>\n<h3 data-heading=\"项目介绍模板 (Q01)\" dir=\"auto\">项目介绍模板 (Q01)</h3>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">[S] 我在XX公司负责XX项目，目标是解决XX问题\n       ↓ 用户量/数据量/业务背景\n[T] 我作为核心开发，负责XX模块的设计和实现\n       ↓ 明确职责范围\n[A] 我采用了XX技术方案，具体做了：1)... 2)... 3)...\n       ↓ 技术细节、决策理由\n[R] 最终效果：延迟降低XX%，准确率提升XX%，获得XX认可\n       ↓ 量化成果 + 个人收获\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h3 data-heading=\"技术挑战模板 (Q03)\" dir=\"auto\">技术挑战模板 (Q03)</h3>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">[S] 在XX项目中，我们遇到了XX挑战（如幻觉率高）\n[T] 我需要将幻觉率从XX%降低到XX%以下\n[A] 我采取了以下措施：\n    1. 诊断根因：XX分析发现主要问题是...\n    2. 方案设计：尝试了A/B/C三种方案...\n    3. 实验验证：小流量实验，指标对比...\n    4. 上线推广：逐步全量，持续监控...\n[R] 幻觉率从XX%降至XX%，获得团队认可，沉淀为最佳实践\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"常见问题与准备建议\" dir=\"auto\">常见问题与准备建议</h2>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>提前准备 3-5 个项目案例</strong> — 覆盖不同类型的挑战</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>用数据说话</strong> — 延迟、准确率、用户量、收入等</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>突出个人贡献</strong> — 用\"我\"而非\"我们\"</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>准备失败案例</strong> — 展示反思和成长</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>了解面试官背景</strong> — 技术/产品/管理不同侧重点</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"相关 MOC\" dir=\"auto\">相关 MOC</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E6%94%BB%E7%95%A5MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E6%94%BB%E7%95%A5MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">面试攻略MOC</a> — 面试准备清单和攻略</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">工程实践MOC</a> — 工程实践的技术深度</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Agent基础概念MOC</a> — Agent 项目的理论基础</li>\n</ul>","headings":[]}